Synthetic multilingual knowledge bundle (100 short documents: 33 Vietnamese,
33 English, 34 Japanese) for the fictional company "Hikari Home", built from
okbase's embed-bench spike data set v2 (spikes/embed-bench/data/v2). queries.json
holds the spike's 300 questions (vi/en/ja, including cross-language) with the id
of the document that answers each one ("gold").

Generated with the help of an LLM. All names and facts are fictional.
Part of okbase; licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0 like the rest of the repository.

